{"id":"b4d6651c12b51126","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-digraphreach.md","title":"有向可达、强连通类与凝聚图","display":"df-digraphreach — 有向可达、强连通类与凝聚图","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-digraphreach","aliases":["27-df-digraphreach"],"display":"df-digraphreach — 有向可达、强连通类与凝聚图","depends_on":["[[27-df-nat]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"Appendix A.2","source_printed_pages":"612–613","source_pdf_pages":"636–637","verification_status":"source-definition-checked","local_review_status":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-digraphreach"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-digraphreach</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-digraphreach — 有向可达、强连通类与凝聚图"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d87d01e5686c19fe\" href=\"?note=d87d01e5686c19fe\" title=\"27-df-nat\">27-df-nat</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Appendix A.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"612–613"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"636–637"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=(V,A)\">\\(D=(V,A)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 为有限集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq V\\times V\">\\(A\\subseteq V\\times V\\)</span>；可含自环。有限序列<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(v_0,\\ldots,v_k)\">\\((v_0,\\ldots,v_k)\\)</span>按指标集<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,\\ldots,k\\}\">\\(\\{0,\\ldots,k\\}\\)</span>编码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R_D\\coloneqq\\{(u,v)\\in V^2:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(v_0,\\ldots,v_k)\\in V^{\\{0,\\ldots,k\\}}\\;(v_0=u\\land v_k=v\\land\\forall i\\in\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j&lt;k\\}\\;((v_i,v_{i+1})\\in A))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R_D\\coloneqq\\{(u,v)\\in V^2:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(v_0,\\ldots,v_k)\\in V^{\\{0,\\ldots,k\\}}\\;(v_0=u\\land v_k=v\\land\\forall i\\in\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j&lt;k\\}\\;((v_i,v_{i+1})\\in A))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall u,v\\in V\\quad u\\sim_Dv\\Longleftrightarrow(u,v)\\in R_D\\land(v,u)\\in R_D.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall u,v\\in V\\quad u\\sim_Dv\\Longleftrightarrow(u,v)\\in R_D\\land(v,u)\\in R_D.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"[u]_D\\coloneqq\\{v\\in V:u\\sim_Dv\\}\\quad(u\\in V),\\qquad\n\\mathcal C_D\\coloneqq\\{[u]_D:u\\in V\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[[u]_D\\coloneqq\\{v\\in V:u\\sim_Dv\\}\\quad(u\\in V),\\qquad\n\\mathcal C_D\\coloneqq\\{[u]_D:u\\in V\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat D\\coloneqq\\left(\\mathcal C_D,\\{(C,C&#39;)\\in\\mathcal C_D^2:C\\ne C&#39;,\\ \\exists u\\in C\\;\\exists v\\in C&#39;\\;(u,v)\\in A\\}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat D\\coloneqq\\left(\\mathcal C_D,\\{(C,C&#39;)\\in\\mathcal C_D^2:C\\ne C&#39;,\\ \\exists u\\in C\\;\\exists v\\in C&#39;\\;(u,v)\\in A\\}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>可达关系采用零长路径的反身版本；互相可达为等价关系，类即强连通分量。凝聚边显式排除C=C′，否则一个非平凡强分量会给自身产生环，与原书“凝聚图无环”的结论冲突。原书简写未写排除自身的条件；这里记录必要的不同分量限制。任一分量间有向环会合并成一个强分量，故凝聚无环。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-nat","status":"resolved","id":"d87d01e5686c19fe","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-nat]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"D=(V,A)","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq V\\times V","display":false},{"tex":"(v_0,\\ldots,v_k)","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0,\\ldots,k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"R_D\\coloneqq\\{(u,v)\\in V^2:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(v_0,\\ldots,v_k)\\in V^{\\{0,\\ldots,k\\}}\\;(v_0=u\\land v_k=v\\land\\forall i\\in\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j<k\\}\\;((v_i,v_{i+1})\\in A))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall u,v\\in V\\quad u\\sim_Dv\\Longleftrightarrow(u,v)\\in R_D\\land(v,u)\\in R_D.","display":true},{"tex":"[u]_D\\coloneqq\\{v\\in V:u\\sim_Dv\\}\\quad(u\\in V),\\qquad\n\\mathcal C_D\\coloneqq\\{[u]_D:u\\in V\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\widehat D\\coloneqq\\left(\\mathcal C_D,\\{(C,C')\\in\\mathcal C_D^2:C\\ne C',\\ \\exists u\\in C\\;\\exists v\\in C'\\;(u,v)\\in A\\}\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1804,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-145","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-df-digraphreach|df-digraphreach — 有向可达、强连通类与凝聚图]]"}],"outgoing":["d87d01e5686c19fe"]}